---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-center text-4xl font-bold text-primary">About Me</h1>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-lg bg-card p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">
          Mission
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          I want to make sailing more approachable, accessible, and affordable
          for more people. This site is one small step to make it easier to find
          a place to start sailing or to continue to learn and compete.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">
          About Me
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          I grew up sailing in Maine. Our 'yacht club' didn't have a bar, launch
          service, or heat. It was maintained by the members and kept up well.
          It was a welcoming place where thousands have learned to sail at an
          early age over the years. More people should be able to experience
          sailing this way.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          I want to make the sport more open, accepting, and accessible. I
          understand why people perceive sailing in a negative light—it's
          expensive and unattainable for many—but through community programs, it
          can be within reach for all.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
